	<section_number>10.1-1317</section_number>
	<catch_line>Judicial review of regulations of Board</catch_line>
	<text>
		The validity of any regulation may be determined through judicial review in accordance with the provisions of the Administrative Process Act (§ 2.2-4000 et seq.).
	</text>
	<history>1971, Ex. Sess., c. 91, § 10-17.23:1; 1986, c. 615; 1988, c. 891.</history>
